<title>FRANCE: Paribas placed SocGen shrs at 570 Fr Weds - sources.</title>
<headline>Paribas placed SocGen shrs at 570 Fr Weds - sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas placed around 700 million francs worth of shares in Societe Generale, which were held by Navigation Mixte, with various investment funds at 570 francs each on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The transaction respresented the 1.35 percent NavMixte held in SocGen, they added on Thursday.</p>
